tivities of the pseudo driver.  The number of  samples  collected
and  prepared  for  userland  consumption.  The number of samples
dropped because the per‐CPU  buffer  was  full.   The  number  of
buffers successfully prepared for userland consumption.  The num‐
ber  of  buffers which have been dropped because they were empty.
The number of buffers dropped because the number of buffers  kept
in  the  kernel exceeds the limit.  The number of samples dropped
because the buffers containing the  samples  were  dropped.   The
